          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na matianĩa kyathĩ nake, mathi nyũmba ĩla wekalĩte andũ aingĩ mũno; amavuanĩsya na kumya ũkũsĩ wa maũndũ ma ũsumbĩ wa Ngai, na aimathing’ĩĩsya ũvoo wa Yesũ, kuma mĩaonĩ ya Mose na mavukunĩ ma athani, kuma kĩoko kũvika wĩoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na amwe nĩmeetĩkĩlile maũndũ ala maneeniwe, na angĩ maiaaĩtĩkĩla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na meethĩwa matekwĩw’ana ene kwa ene, maithi Vaulo amatavya ndeto ĩno ĩmwe, Veva Mũtheu nĩwaneenie nesa na aaĩthe menyu, na kanyw’a wa mwathani Isaia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
